Several months ago I upgraded to RH7.3 from RH7.2 and got then bad keyboard 
lock-ups when trying to play games or when the sreensaver would switch to 
blank screen. The problem could not be resolved on this forum and I had to 
install RH7.2 again. (What is Linux w/o its screensavers?)

It turned out that the culprit is somehow the onboard video card SiS630 even 
so it works well with RH7.2.

I now took the video card from my old PS1 computer put it into the PCI slot of 
the motherboard, upgraded again to RH7.3 and all games and screensaver run 
smoothly with no keyboard lock-ups.

